  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EVALUATION OF EU SUPPORT ON THE WASTE MANAGEMENT AND URBAN WASTEWATER TREATMENT IN WESTERN BALKANS (2016-2022)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: EVALUATION OF EU SUPPORT ON THE WASTE MANAGEMENT AND URBAN WASTEWATER TREATMENT IN WESTERN BALKANS (2016-2022) - This work programme sets out the implementation measures of the operational expenditures to finance evaluation and monitoring of external assistance activities , planned under the 2021 allocation from lines 14.020112  and 14.200404 of the general budget of the European Union to the Directorate-General for Neighbourhood and Enlargement (DG NEAR), for a total amount of EUR 6,200,000  subject to the availability of the requisite appropriations on the budget line concerned.</narrative>
  </description>
